 "reference": "Numerics @ 2a0357a, RMC-BestFit @ c2e6192. Every case's numeric literals are transcribed verbatim from the upstream test files (not computed by this port's own C++): the seven Numerics links from Test_LinkFunctions.cs, Test_FisherZLink.cs (Link_KnownValues/InverseLink_KnownValues/DLink_FiniteDifferenceConsistency), and Test_YeoJohnsonLink.cs (Link_LambdaZero_UsesPositiveLogBranch/Link_LambdaTwo_UsesNegativeLogBranch/Link_LambdaOne_IsIdentity); the five BestFit-specific links from ASinHLinkTests.cs (Test_SymmetricCase_ReducesToSimpleAsinh), SESLinkTests.cs (Test_InverseLink_AtZero_ReturnsZero), LogSESLinkTests.cs (Test_InverseLink_AtZero_ReturnsSigma0), LogASinHLinkTests.cs (SymmetricBaseline_ReducesToCenteredLogLink), and CenteredLinkTests.cs (Test_Link_IdentityInner_KnownValues/Test_InverseLink_IdentityInner_KnownValues/Test_DLink_IdentityInner_KnownValue). The twelve `type` names this file exercises are every one the toolbox `link` group's `build_link` recognizes (numerics/support/toolbox/link.hpp): the seven Numerics LinkFunctionType members plus the five link-specific BestFit types (YeoJohnson counted once).",
